      "articleText": "New packages for Humble Hawksbill 2026-10-12 - ROS Announcements and News - Open Robotics Discourse New packages for Humble Hawksbill 2026-10-12 ROS ROS Announcements and News release , humble christophebedard October 12, 2026, 4:55pm 1 We’re happy to announce 40 new packages and 446 updates to ROS 2 Humble Hawksbill This sync was tagged as humble/2026-10-12 . amd64 (40 new, 446 updates) Package Updates for humble Added Packages [115]: ros-humble-as2-platform-mavlink: 1.1.0-1 ros-humble-as2-platform-mavlink-dbgsym: 1.1.0-1 ros-humble-easynav : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-bonxai-maps-manager : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-bonxai-maps-manager-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-common : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-controller : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-controller-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-core : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-core-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-costmap-common : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-costmap-common-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-costmap-localizer : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-costmap-localizer-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-costmap-maps-manager : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-costmap-maps-manager-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-costmap-planner : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-costmap-planner-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-diagnostic-recovery : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-diagnostic-recovery-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-fusion-localizer : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-fusion-localizer-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-interfaces : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-interfaces-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-localizer : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-localizer-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-maps-manager : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-maps-manager-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-mhamcl-localizer : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-mhamcl-localizer-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-mpc-controller : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-mpc-controller-dbgsym: 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-mppi-controller : 0.5.0-1 ros-humble-easynav-mppi-c