      "summary": "Hi everyone This follows up on our ROS 2 bridge for Smartgloves II . We’ve released a new version of the Rokoko Device SDK, which the bridge is built on. What’s new: More robust USB data stream: handles the SDK closing abruptly (requested by several customers) New Smartgloves II firmware: small improvements in power usage and performance OTA ready: from the next release, Smartgloves II can be updated over WiFi Pinch detector example: recognises thumb-to-index, middle, ring and pinky pinches on both gloves Minor driver bugfixes, plus general cleanup of the driver and the docs site Try the pinch detector: Pinch Detection Example | ROKOKO Device SDK Docs: https://sdk.rokoko.com Bridge: GitHub - Rokoko/rokoko-ros2-bridge: A ROS2 bridge to be used with Rokoko's Smartgloves II along the Rokoko Device SDK · GitHub 1 post - 1 participant Read full topic",
