      "articleText": "Rokoko Device SDK update: more robust USB stream, OTA-ready Smartgloves II and a pinch detector example - Projects - Open Robotics Discourse Rokoko Device SDK update: more robust USB stream, OTA-ready Smartgloves II and a pinch detector example Projects release , ros2 , drivers , hardware Olivia_Rokoko October 12, 2026, 4:27pm 1 Hi everyone This follows up on our ROS 2 bridge for Smartgloves II . We’ve released a new version of the Rokoko Device SDK, which the bridge is built on. What’s new: More robust USB data stream: handles the SDK closing abruptly (requested by several customers) New Smartgloves II firmware: small improvements in power usage and performance OTA ready: from the next release, Smartgloves II can be updated over WiFi Pinch detector example: recognises thumb-to-index, middle, ring and pinky pinches on both gloves Minor driver bugfixes, plus general cleanup of the driver and the docs site Try the pinch detector: Pinch Detection Example | ROKOKO Device SDK Docs: https://sdk.rokoko.com Bridge: GitHub - Rokoko/rokoko-ros2-bridge: A ROS2 bridge to be used with Rokoko's Smartgloves II along the Rokoko Device SDK · GitHub 1 Like Related topics Topic Replies Views Activity Rokoko ROS 2 bridge for Smartgloves II is released ROS General release , ros2 , drivers , teleoperation , lyrical 0 65 October 7, 2026 The release of the Conduit iOS app—transform your Apple devices into ROS 2 sensor publishers Projects ros2 , ios , iphone , zenoh 5 939 April 21, 2026 Robot DevKit for ROS2 Dashing Diademata ROS General release , ros2 1 891 September 12, 2019 New packages for ROS 2 Humble Hawksbill 2022-11-01 ROS Announcements and News release , humble 6 3238 October 10, 2023 New packages and patch release for Humble Hawksbill 2024-05-23 ROS Announcements and News release , humble 0 897 May 23, 2024",
