      "articleText": "Build it. Explore it. Race and fly. A whole town made of bricks – with a race track, an airfield, buses out to the volcano and room for a house of your own. Shared live with everyone online. Play now – free Looking for players … Server Phone & computer Nothing to download No sign-up Meet me at the rainbow B. The middle of town turns around a giant rainbow letter. Signposts point to every corner of the world, the lookout tower catches the last sun, and the café always has a free table. The glass tower The Hall of Fame The café The B by day The Brick Store Fill your pockets. Bricks in every color – and every part the town itself is built from. The car dealer Pick a car, drive it off the lot and take your friend for a spin. One more lap. Then one more. The race track starts at a gantry with a live board: today’s fastest laps, everyone’s name on it. Beat the time, take the top spot – until someone beats you. The tower Over the rooftops Over the mountains Night flight Departures Bus 1–4 Flower fields Blossom grove Canyon City Every bus is driven by a robot. Your driver Out of town Last stop: blossom grove Hands on the wheel Volcano A lake of glowing lava Mountains Snow on the peaks Beach Palms around a blue lagoon Canyon Red rock and cactus Winter forest Fir trees in deep snow Flower fields Color as far as you can see Stud by stud Hundreds of bricks in every color. Snap them together, turn them, take them back – a house, a tower, whatever you like. Land of your own The Land Office sells lots. Put your name on one and build what you want – nobody can knock it down. Everyone you meet is real. Well – except the bus driver. Say hi, chat, send a gift of coins and bricks, race your friends, or just hang out by the B and watch the town go by. How to play Every button is on screen when you need it. This is the short version. Keyboard Touch W A S D Walk, mouse to look Space Jump – twice for a double jump Click Place a brick, right-click takes it back R C Turn the brick, pick a color V Change the view E Get into a buggy or plane L Your land T Chat Tab Who is online, send gifts Esc Menu and all controls Left thumb walks Swipe on the right to look around Jump Tap twice for a double jump Hammer Build – then tap Place Camera Change the view Car Get into a buggy or plane Two fingers Zoom Speech bubble Chat Our sponsors The companies that put their name into the city – thank you. Become a sponsor No main sponsor yet The glass tower in the middle of the city is still free – become our main sponsor Sponsor houses Available A whole sponsor house Available A whole sponsor house Available A whole sponsor house Available A whole sponsor house Buses Available Available Available Kiosks Available Available Available Available Race track banners, bus stop posters and lamp flags @i_am_fabs EuroPDF Swat.io + 31 free spaces See you in there. Play now – free",
