      "articleText": "## Packages\r\n\r\n| Package | Version | Registry | In this release |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| `@modelcontextprotocol/server-everything` | `1.0.0` | npm | **published** |\r\n| `@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem` | `1.0.0` | npm | **published** |\r\n| `@modelcontextprotocol/server-memory` | `1.0.0` | npm | **published** |\r\n| `@modelcontextprotocol/server-sequential-thinking` | `1.0.0` | npm | **published** |\r\n| `mcp-server-fetch` | `2026.10.10` | PyPI | **published** |\r\n| `mcp-server-git` | `2026.10.10` | PyPI | **published** |\r\n| `mcp-server-time` | `2026.10.10` | PyPI | **published** |\r\n\r\nRelease ledger: [v2/chore/5080-release-v1.0.0-sdk1](https://claude.ai/artifact/GP9jycCFtcYBaikubx3xwc)\r\n\r\n## @modelcontextprotocol/server-everything 1.0.0\r\n\r\n### What's Changed\r\n\r\n* fix(everything): clean up subscriptions on session disconnect by @arimu1 in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4712\r\n* Agentic software factory Part 2: AGENTS.md, the absolute rules; delete CLAUDE.md by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4894\r\n* Agentic software factory Part 4: TypeScript workspace gate (Prettier, ESLint, root validate, CI) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4896\r\n* feat: changesets for the TypeScript servers, GitHub-Release-triggered publishing by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4927\r\n* fix(everything): SSE reports a port already in use instead of \"Server is running\" by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4936\r\n* test(everything): protocol-level characterization suite and per-file 90% coverage gate by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4978\r\n* fix(everything): label dynamic blob resources application/octet-stream by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5005\r\n* fix(everything): answer unknown and duplicate HTTP+SSE sessions (#4981) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5020\r\n* fix(everything): scope session resources to their server (#4808) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5032\r\n* fix(everything): instructions qualify capability-gated tools; gate trigger-elicitation-request on form mode by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5034\r\n* fix(everything): keep async task tools within their client task (#4986, #4987) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5014\r\n* fix(everything): Streamable HTTP 404 for unknown sessions, per-stream replay, shutdown closes sessions by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5006\r\n* chore(everything): keep compiled tests and vitest config out of the published package by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5053\r\n* v1.0.0: release audit for the SDK 1.x release branch by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5087\r\n* v1.0.0: fold pending changesets into a 1.0.0 CHANGELOG (release branch) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5088\r\n* Release v1.0.0: merge v2/release/1.0.0 into main by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5090\r\n\r\n## @modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem 1.0.0\r\n\r\n### What's Changed\r\n\r\n* fix: declare zod runtime dependencies by @he-yufeng in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4289\r\n* Agentic software factory Part 4: TypeScript workspace gate (Prettier, ESLint, root validate, CI) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4896\r\n* filesystem: fix unicode-paths tests on macOS by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4901\r\n* feat: changesets for the TypeScript servers, GitHub-Release-triggered publishing by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4927\r\n* test(filesystem): in-process characterization suite and per-file 90% coverage gate by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4977\r\n* fix(filesystem): resolve paths that differ from disk only in Unicode form (#1970) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5009\r\n* fix(filesystem): admit paths under a UNC share root allowed directory by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5010\r\n* fix(filesystem): wait for initial roots before tool calls; fail visibly with no directories by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5025\r\n* fix(filesystem): declare JSON Schema 2020-12 on every tool schema by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5030\r\n* fix(filesystem): overwrite existing files in place (#4512, #3199) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5022\r\n* fix(filesystem): keep line endings and indentation in edit_file by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5011\r\n* chore(ci): run the test suites on Windows runners by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5047\r\n* v1.0.0: release audit for the SDK 1.x release branch by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5087\r\n* v1.0.0: fold pending changesets into a 1.0.0 CHANGELOG (release branch) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5088\r\n* v1.0.0: cherry-pick the #5094 roots revocation fix onto the release branch by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5096\r\n* v1.0.0: cherry-pick the #5097 roots refresh ordering fix onto the release branch by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5099\r\n* v1.0.0: cherry-pick the #5101 roots refresh barrier onto the release branch by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5103\r\n* Release v1.0.0: merge v2/release/1.0.0 into main by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5090\r\n\r\n## @modelcontextprotocol/server-memory 1.0.0\r\n\r\n### What's Changed\r\n\r\n* fix(memory): resolve Vitest false positive for expected rejection by @JosephDoUrden in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/3893\r\n* fix(memory): read serverInfo.version from package.json by @syf2211 in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4407\r\n* fix(memory): reject dangling relations by @jstar0 in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4477\r\n* fix: declare zod runtime dependencies by @he-yufeng in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4289\r\n* fix(memory): add trailing newline to JSONL output by @nickveenhof in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/3653\r\n* fix(memory): expand leading ~ in MEMORY_FILE_PATH to the home directory by @ameyypawar in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4447\r\n* fix(memory): stop reporting deletions that did not happen by @ConnorMoss02 in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4738\r\n* fix(memory): validate knowledge graph entries when loading from disk by @Ethanz11-creat in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4717\r\n* fix(memory): constrain search_nodes query length by @feiiiiii5 in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4662\r\n* fix(memory): skip duplicate entities and relations within a single batch by @JSap0914 in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4383\r\n* fix(memory): serialize graph mutations to prevent concurrent write race by @Nandini-Inuguru in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4555\r\n* Agentic software factory Part 4: TypeScript workspace gate (Prettier, ESLint, root validate, CI) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4896\r\n* feat: changesets for the TypeScript servers, GitHub-Release-triggered publishing by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4927\r\n* fix(memory): run the file-path tests in a temporary directory by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4937\r\n* test(memory): protocol-level characterization suite and per-file 90% coverage gate by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4973\r\n* fix(memory): keep unreadable lines when saving the graph (#4885) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5035\r\n* fix(memory): report entities that create_entities skipped (#4887) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5008\r\n* fix(memory): lock the graph file across processes so two servers on one file keep both writes (#4797) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5037\r\n* fix(memory): keep the memory file's mode across saves and refuse a read-only file (#4827) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5013\r\n* chore(everything): keep compiled tests and vitest config out of the published package by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5053\r\n* v1.0.0: cherry-pick #5077 and #5078 onto the release branch by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5086\r\n* v1.0.0: release audit for the SDK 1.x release branch by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5087\r\n* v1.0.0: fold pending changesets into a 1.0.0 CHANGELOG (release branch) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5088\r\n* Release v1.0.0: merge v2/release/1.0.0 into main by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5090\r\n\r\n## @modelcontextprotocol/server-sequential-thinking 1.0.0\r\n\r\n### What's Changed\r\n\r\n* fix: declare zod runtime dependencies by @he-yufeng in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4289\r\n* Agentic software factory Part 4: TypeScript workspace gate (Prettier, ESLint, root validate, CI) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4896\r\n* feat: changesets for the TypeScript servers, GitHub-Release-triggered publishing by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4927\r\n* test(sequentialthinking): in-process protocol suite and per-file 90% coverage gate by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4970\r\n* fix(sequentialthinking): set readOnlyHint and idempotentHint to false by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5015\r\n* fix(sequentialthinking): track branchIds that name Object.prototype keys; leave state unchanged on failure by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5036\r\n* fix(sequentialthinking): no \"undefined\" in thought log headers, border sized from visible text by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5031\r\n* chore(everything): keep compiled tests and vitest config out of the published package by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5053\r\n* v1.0.0: release audit for the SDK 1.x release branch by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5087\r\n* v1.0.0: fold pending changesets into a 1.0.0 CHANGELOG (release branch) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5088\r\n* Release v1.0.0: merge v2/release/1.0.0 into main by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/5090\r\n\r\n## mcp-server-fetch 2026.10.10\r\n\r\n### What's Changed\r\n\r\n* Agentic software factory Part 5: Python gate parity (validate:py, ruff in CI) by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4893\r\n* Agentic software factory Part 9: contribution model: issues not PRs, issue forms, backlog plan by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4904\r\n* test(fetch): protocol-level characterization tests and per-file coverage by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/pull/4971\r\n* fix(fetch,git,time): report the package version in serverInfo by @cliffhall in https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/",
